<gpx version="1.1" creator="Good Shit" xmlns="http://www.topografix.com/GPX/1/1"><trk><name>Trolltunga from Mågelitopp (P3) — P3 Mågelitopp–Trolltunga return</name><desc>From the walking trail beside P3 Mågelitopp, cross the footbridges and climb through Gryteskar to Trombeskar. Continue across the plateau past Floren, Endåen and Tyssehøl to the Trolltunga viewpoint, then return along the same route.

